-Never.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.614 line:92%
And she was my French teacher.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:15.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was she your actual --
-Yeah.

00:00:15.749 --> 00:00:17.517 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I had a French teacher
