a little bit.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:31.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I always feel it's
dangerous when you tell people

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.266
your mom's a French teache
because then they just jum

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.568
to the assumption
