00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:36.669 size:75% position:38% line:92%
and now know French.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Immediately.
-Immediately.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:40.073
