00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:12.372 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And, you know,

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:13.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's a magnificent achievement
the first movie.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:16.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
And for me, the thing
that I loved so much about i

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:19.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
