00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:49.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause it's
a collective experience.

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:51.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
You feel that anxiety
and that jeopardy

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:54.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that tension with
everybody else in the cinema

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:57.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is kind of what
it was made for, cinema.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:01.721
-Are they then very excited that
their dad is in the sequel

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:03.156 line:92%
