-Yeah, 'cause I've never heard
someone say, "Oh, you have kids?

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:35.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
You've got to watch
'Peaky Blinders.'"

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.290 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-[ Laughs ] Yeah. No.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-No.

